<title>SPAIN: Spain's Endesa gets 10-yr, 12 bln pta loan.</title>
<headline>Spain's Endesa gets 10-yr, 12 bln pta loan.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish electrical group Endesa obtained a 10-year, 12 billion peseta syndicated loan with the Spanish Savings Bank Association CECA, the association said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The first six billion tranche is at a fixed eight-percent, while the second six billion trance is at a fixed rate of 7.71 percent.</p>
<p>Both tranches can be converted to variable rates under certain conditions.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
